ood_202607101922.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Person_leaning_into_hood_202607101922.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1962, a new kind of machine promised to simulate reality.","kw":["kind","machine","promised","simulate","reality"],"ch":3},{"t":43.89,"dur":3.92,"clip":"03_sensorama/Technical_diagrams_for_Sensorama_202607101922.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Technical_diagrams_for_Sensorama_202607101922.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1962, an inventor patented a machine.","kw":["inventor","patented","machine"],"ch":3},{"t":54.6,"dur":2.8,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","in":6.98,"text":"Thus, man and machine enter a new era.","kw":["thus","machine","enter"],"ch":3},{"t":63.85,"dur":6.6,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"The Censorama offers a fully integrated experience, with simulated wind and aroma to enhance the illusion.","kw":["censorama","offers","fully","integrated","experience","simulated","wind","aroma"],"ch":3},{"t":71.72,"dur":6,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851_2.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851_2.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"It simulates a fully immersive environment. Witness the future of sensory realism.","kw":["simulates","fully","immersive","environment","witness","future","sensory","realism"],"ch":3},{"t":81.63,"dur":2.24,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_mot…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_mot…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"Step right up and experience the future.","kw":["step","right","experience","future"],"ch":3},{"t":86.37,"dur":2.64,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"Step right up and experience the future!","kw":["step","right","experience","future"],"ch":3},{"t":92.12,"dur":5.08,"clip":"03_sensorama/Amusement_arcade_at_night_202607101922.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Amusement_arcade_at_night_202607101922.mp4","in":10.4,"text":"More versioning delay.","kw":["more","versioning","delay"],"ch":3},{"t":101.92,"dur":3.28,"clip":"03_sensorama/Technical_diagrams_for_Sensorama_202607101922.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Technical_diagrams_for_Sensorama_202607101922.mp4","in":6.6,"text":"by feeding sensations directly to the nervous system.","kw":["feeding","sensations","directly","nervous","system"],"ch":3},{"t":110.25,"dur":4,"clip":"03_sensorama/Inventor's_workshop_demonstratio…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Inventor's_workshop_demonstratio…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the pursuit of precision, component must work in harmony.","kw":["pursuit","precision","component","must","work","harmony"],"ch":3},{"t":117.24,"dur":4.2,"clip":"03_sensorama/Person_leaning_into_hood_202607101922.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/Person_leaning_into_hood_202607101922.mp4","in":5.68,"text":"But it was all an illusion, designed to control us.","kw":["illusion","designed","control"],"ch":3},{"t":124.33,"dur":4,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851_2.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851_2.mp4","in":0,"text":"This is the Sensorama, a revolution in cinematography.","kw":["sensorama","revolution","cinematography"],"ch":3},{"t":129.47,"dur":2.72,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101851.mp4","in":2.52,"text":"The Sensorama will fully immerse your senses.","kw":["sensorama","will","fully","immerse","your","senses"],"ch":3},{"t":135.08,"dur":2.4,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_mot…_202607101851.mp4","file":"asset